{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Commencer", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": " Connaissez-vous  le quartier ?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant fait usage de l'information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire concernant les gens, leurs go\u00fbts et leurs d\u00e9go\u00fbts, leur lieu de r\u00e9sidence ou leur pays, dans des situations communicatives.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Demander et dire o\u00f9 sont les endroits dans votre quartier", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Un quartier repr\u00e9sente l'endroit o\u00f9 vous habitez. Pour savoir o\u00f9 sont les endroits dans votre quartier, vous demandez :<br/>\u201cO\u00f9 est le (masc.) ou la (f\u00e9m.)... ?\u201d<br/>Pour parler des endroits au pluriel, vous demandez :<br/>\u201cO\u00f9 sont les... ?\"", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"3\",\"columns\":\"3\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"O\u00f9 est la...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"biblioth\u00e8que ?\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Il y a\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"une biblioth\u00e8que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pr\u00e8s de chez moi.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Il y a beaucoup de \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"parcs\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dans le quartier.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Les articles d\u00e9finis et ind\u00e9finis", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Vous utilisez l'article d\u00e9fini <span class = \"strong\">le (masc.) </span> ou<span class = \"strong\"> la (f\u00e9m.) </span> pour parler d'un nom  <span class = \"italic\">sp\u00e9cifique</span>  (personne, endroit ou chose).<br/>Vous utilisez un article ind\u00e9fini <span class = \"strong\">un (masc.)</span> et <span class = \"strong\">une (f\u00e9m.) </span>pour parler de quelque chose de <span class = \"italic\">g\u00e9n\u00e9ral. </span><br/>Vous utilisez <span class = \"strong\">un/une</span> avant un nom.<br/>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Le chien est beau.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "La maison est grande.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Dans une biblioth\u00e8que, il y a beaucoup de livres int\u00e9ressants.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le parc", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un endroit public o\u00f9 il y a de l'herbe et des arbres", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il y a beaucoup de parcs dans le quartier.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Ces mots sont utilis\u00e9s pour parler des endroits sp\u00e9cifiques dans une ville.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la biblioth\u00e8que", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un immeuble o\u00f9 l'on peut emprunter des livres", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'aime prendre des livres \u00e0 la biblioth\u00e8que.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le caf\u00e9", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00e9tablissement o\u00f9 l'on consomme des boissons", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Est-ce que vous voulez aller au caf\u00e9 ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le restaurant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un endroit o\u00f9 l'on commande de la nourriture", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  Il y a un restaurant italien \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de chez moi.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le cin\u00e9ma", "type": "name"}, {"content": "salle de spectacle o\u00f9 l'on regarde des films", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le cin\u00e9ma est loin d ici.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "loin ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pas \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 d'un endroit", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'habite loin d'ici.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "l\u00e0-bas", "type": "name"}, {"content": "quand on d\u00e9signe quelque chose \u00e0 distance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il y a un bon restaurant l\u00e0-bas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la poste", "type": "name"}, {"content": "endroit o\u00f9 l'on poste des lettres et ach\u00e8te des timbres", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je vais \u00e0 la poste.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\u00c9crivez une liste de 4-8 endroits dans votre quartier.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "D\u00e9crivez les endroits. \u00c9crivez 2-3 phrases pour chaque endroit.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Comparez votre liste \u00e0 celle de votre partenaire.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ajoutez des photos ou des dessins de diff\u00e9rents endroits.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Je d\u00e9cris des endroits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris des phrases compl\u00e8tes quand je d\u00e9cris des endroits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'utilise des adjectifs correctement.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Salut Jean, allons d\u00e9jeuner !<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : D'accord. O\u00f9 \u00e7a ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "4000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Veux-tu aller au caf\u00e9 ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Non, il n'y a pas de d\u00e9jeuner l\u00e0. Il y a un restaurant italien pr\u00e8s du cin\u00e9ma. Tu veux y aller ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "11000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Euh, o\u00f9 est-il ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : C'est pas tr\u00e8s loin d'ici. Il se trouve au 64, rue du chemin Vert."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "17000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : \u00a0Chimo Vert.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : \u00a064, rue du Chemin Vert. C-H-E-M-I-N Vert.<br />\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Ah d'accord, j'ai compris."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "28000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Est-ce que c'est une biblioth\u00e8que l\u00e0-bas ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Oui ! j'aime prendre un livre et lire dans un  parc. Il y a beaucoup de parcs dans mon quartier."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "36000", "id": 6, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Et cet immeuble... est-ce un mus\u00e9e ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Non, ce n'est pas un mus\u00e9e, c'est une galerie d'art. On peut y aller apr\u00e8s le d\u00e9jeuner."}], "audiosrc": "frn2le01ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "a